The Nsight Compute analysis modules under my_utils/profiling/ncu/
(metric_catalog.py, ncu_diagnostics.py, sampling_validity.py,
shipped_rules.py) re-implement checks, thresholds, and stall-reason
semantics from the rule scripts distributed with NVIDIA Nsight Compute
(Copyright (c) NVIDIA CORPORATION, BSD-3-Clause), and a small number of
short advisory sentences closely track the wording of those rules'
messages. No NVIDIA source files are included in this distribution.
